        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\nIn `computeStaggeredCronNextRunAtMs` and `computeStaggeredCronPreviousRunAtMs`, the conditions inside the loops are mathematically guaranteed to evaluate to `true` on the very first iteration. This makes the 4-iteration loops, cursor recalculations, and related logic completely dead/redundant code.\n\n## Evidence\nPassed tests on branch `fix/2.4-cron-stagger-dead-loop-removal`:\n```\n ✓ |cron| src/cron/stagger.test.ts (5 tests) 29ms\n ✓ |cron| src/cron/service.jobs.top-of-hour-stagger.test.ts (6 tests) 49ms\n```",
